Scope, and other people's work.

The licence above covers the scripts and packaging in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the game. Skate 3 is not distributed here or in the IPA;
players supply their own copy.

It does NOT cover the code this port is built on. The published IPA is a binary
distribution that includes work by other authors under their own licences -
notably darchap (BSD 3-Clause), whose ambient-crowd and movable-prop cuts are in
the shipped binary, and the upstream Skate 3 recompilation by Alex McHugh.

Those notices are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which travels with the
release. Read it as part of this licence rather than beside it.

